# ---- Buildable: outputs, intermediates, logs ----
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.DS_Store
Intermediate-llvm/
Release/
*.plist
validatere-*.log
recon.log
# The build's own output tree. NOT GUI/Output — despite the name that is a build
# *input*: Tools/Build/build.py copies it into the install dir.
Examples/*/Output/

# ---- Downloadable: the Reason RE SDK itself ----
# Unzip JukeboxSDK_500_028 (see version.txt) over this checkout to build.
# Only the extension is mastered here.
/API/
/Documentation/
/Licenses/
/Tools/
/version.txt
Examples/*
!Examples/YouKnow/

# GUI2D/, GUI/Output/ and Resources/Public/ are deliberately NOT ignored. The
# Design/ scripts refine them in place — they read the existing files back and
# re-emit them — so those files carry source state that exists nowhere else:
# generate_presets.py re-emits the 18 original sounds from their own stored
# parameter values, and render_panels.py composites GUI2D/PatchBrowseGroup.png,
# which nothing generates. See Docs/ASSET_PROVENANCE.md.
